WEBVTT

1
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.166
In the next two verses,

2
00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:41.083
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:43.750
is describing some important things

4
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.875
for making progress on the path of yoga.

5
00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:53.125
Lord Krishna says

6
00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.958
that a person should practice yoga

7
00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:58.708
with firm determination and a cheerful mind.

8
00:00:58.708 --> 00:01:01.166
And renouncing desires completely,

9
00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:03.083
a person should control all senses

10
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:07.291
with the help of the mind in every situation.

11
00:01:07.291 --> 00:01:10.583
Many times we take some resolution,

12
00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:13.625
but then if results don't come quickly,

13
00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:14.666
getting discouraged,

14
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:18.541
it doesn't take long for this resolution to break.

15
00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:21.791
Yoga won't happen with such weak resolutions.

16
00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:23.708
The path of yoga is long,

17
00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:26.875
so firmness of resolution is extremely essential.

18
00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:28.208
Firmness in this –

19
00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:30.833
that however much time success takes,

20
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:34.500
we will remain steadfast on this path.

21
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.041
The state of deep meditation,

22
00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:38.375
or becoming free from material desires,

23
00:01:38.375 --> 00:01:40.375
this won't happen quickly.

24
00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:43.166
If the whole life has been spent in materialism,

25
00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:45.875
never paid attention to spirituality,

26
00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:49.000
then now change will also happen gradually.

27
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.666
And reaching the supreme state of yoga

28
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.791
described in previous verses

29
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:55.791
might even take many births.

30
00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:58.666
And here comes the matter of faith,

31
00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:02.125
because only from that 
can resolution become firm.

32
00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:03.833
We must have faith

33
00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:05.916
that every step of spiritual progress

34
00:02:05.916 --> 00:02:08.291
is taking us closer to our goal.

35
00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:09.416
And if there's true faith in the mind

36
00:02:09.416 --> 00:02:10.375
that we are moving forward

37
00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:12.208
and going toward such a result

38
00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:14.833
where there will be complete freedom

39
00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:17.541
from all sufferings,

40
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:20.583
then think how pleasant a state this is.

41
00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:23.375
And if this faith is true,

42
00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:26.125
then why wouldn't there 
be cheerfulness in the mind?

43
00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:28.416
Keeping this very faith,

44
00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:29.875
Lord Krishna says to walk on this path

45
00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:31.625
with cheerfulness.

46
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:34.041
Cheerfulness is a sign that faith is maintained.

47
00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:37.916
And unpleasantness is also a sign

48
00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:41.500
that we need to increase firmness and faith.

49
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.333
After this,

50
00:02:42.333 --> 00:02:46.333
Lord Krishna gives us the message 
to renounce material desires.

51
00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:49.083
Why do desires arise?

52
00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:51.125
They arise from this thought

53
00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:55.708
that some material thing or external 
experience will give us happiness.

54
00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:56.458
See,

55
00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:57.916
this is also a sign

56
00:02:57.916 --> 00:03:00.375
that if you've started searching 
for happiness outside,

57
00:03:00.375 --> 00:03:03.875
it means the connection with your inner self

58
00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:05.458
is decreasing.

59
00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:08.541
Material desires in this way

60
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:11.875
distract our attention from 
the inner self and yoga.

61
00:03:11.875 --> 00:03:13.333
Lord Krishna tells us to

62
00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:16.291
control the senses with our mind.

63
00:03:16.291 --> 00:03:20.291
Because the senses will be attracted
toward pleasure and enjoyment,

64
00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:22.375
but keeping them under control

65
00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:24.833
depends on the mind's power.

66
00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:27.083
The main message here is

67
00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:29.208
that we must keep our resolution firm,

68
00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:30.625
if we start wandering,

69
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:33.041
we must stabilize on the path again.

70
00:03:33.041 --> 00:03:35.250
If our efforts remain true,

71
00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.666
then Lord Krishna's grace will also be there.

72
00:03:37.666 --> 00:03:39.041
Remember,

73
00:03:39.041 --> 00:03:41.666
Lord Krishna will definitely help.

74
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:45.583
We only need to show dedication toward him.

75
00:03:50.125 --> 00:03:54.375
Firm determination and faith –

76
00:03:54.375 --> 00:03:57.083
these two things are essential

77
00:03:57.083 --> 00:04:00.833
not only for progress in yoga,

78
00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:03.125
but if anything important

79
00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:06.208
is to be achieved in life,

80
00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:09.708
it won't work without them.

81
00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:13.791
Many people make effort and work hard.

82
00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:17.458
But only firmness and faith determine

83
00:04:17.458 --> 00:04:20.666
who will get discouraged

84
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:24.750
and stop quickly,

85
00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:30.833
and who will keep walking
 even after enthusiasm wavers.

86
00:04:30.833 --> 00:04:35.750
And only one who keeps 
walking will reach the destination.

87
00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:40.458
Think – a farmer sows seeds,

88
00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:44.125
adds fertilizer, gives water,

89
00:04:44.125 --> 00:04:48.833
but for many days no change is visible.

90
00:04:48.833 --> 00:04:51.000
But he doesn't stop.

91
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.416
Because he has faith

92
00:04:53.416 --> 00:04:56.625
that the seed will sprout one day,

93
00:04:56.625 --> 00:05:02.125
there will be a flourishing crop before him.

94
00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:05.250
Life is also like this.

95
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.958
Whether it's personal success,
 mutual relationships,

96
00:05:08.958 --> 00:05:11.875
or spiritual development:

97
00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:14.375
whatever is valuable

98
00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:18.541
takes time to attain.

99
00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:21.125
But many people break down,

100
00:05:21.125 --> 00:05:26.416
stop, because of delay in results.

101
00:05:26.416 --> 00:05:30.125
And in such moments, faith will work.

102
00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:32.750
To reawaken faith,

103
00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.916
remember these two things:

104
00:05:34.916 --> 00:05:37.791
First, remember

105
00:05:37.791 --> 00:05:40.916
why you started walking on this path.

106
00:05:40.916 --> 00:05:43.041
Imagine your destination.

107
00:05:43.041 --> 00:05:45.916
And think,

108
00:05:45.916 --> 00:05:49.583
would it be appropriate

109
00:05:49.583 --> 00:05:52.750
to give up that future success

110
00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:57.291
because of a few moments of discouragement?

111
00:05:57.291 --> 00:05:58.791
Second,

112
00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:01.583
look back once

113
00:06:01.583 --> 00:06:05.541
and see how much progress you've made so far.

114
00:06:05.541 --> 00:06:10.916
Meaning you're coming closer to the destination.

115
00:06:10.916 --> 00:06:15.208
Every small step moves you forward,

116
00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:19.416
but we often forget this

117
00:06:19.416 --> 00:06:24.458
and get discouraged.

118
00:06:24.458 --> 00:06:27.083
So just reawaken faith

119
00:06:27.083 --> 00:06:31.125
and move forward with firmness.

120
00:06:31.125 --> 00:06:33.375
Success will definitely be attained.

121
00:06:37.708 --> 00:06:43.125
To reach the supreme state of yoga,

122
00:06:43.125 --> 00:06:47.041
renunciation of desires is essential.

123
00:06:47.041 --> 00:06:49.791
And in social life too,

124
00:06:49.791 --> 00:06:53.250
if not complete renunciation,

125
00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:57.291
control over desires

126
00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:58.833
is necessary,

127
00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:03.541
otherwise sorrow will never leave you.

128
00:07:03.541 --> 00:07:06.375
Look at this world –

129
00:07:06.375 --> 00:07:08.041
everyone is running

130
00:07:08.041 --> 00:07:11.458
after achieving something –

131
00:07:11.458 --> 00:07:14.541
sometimes wealth, sometimes position,

132
00:07:14.541 --> 00:07:17.791
or praise of oneself

133
00:07:17.791 --> 00:07:20.833
by others.

134
00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:25.541
But however much is achieved,

135
00:07:25.541 --> 00:07:29.791
peace and happiness don't remain in hand,

136
00:07:29.791 --> 00:07:31.541
they just slip away.

137
00:07:31.541 --> 00:07:34.500
This happens because

138
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.625
as soon as one achievement is attained,

139
00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:40.250
it starts seeming ordinary.

140
00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:44.458
Now craving for a new achievement awakens.

141
00:07:44.458 --> 00:07:48.500
Some people gave praise, so now the mind

142
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.666
demands even more praise.

143
00:07:51.666 --> 00:07:53.500
Desires

144
00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:57.750
 are like ghee in fire –

145
00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.958
the more desires you keep,

146
00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:04.750
the more this fire will blaze.

147
00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:08.666
And happiness will keep moving farther away.

148
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:12.000
Because the source of happiness

149
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.958
is neither in achievements

150
00:08:13.958 --> 00:08:17.000
nor in others' praise.

151
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.666
Happiness comes only from a calm

152
00:08:20.666 --> 00:08:24.916
and content mind.

153
00:08:24.916 --> 00:08:26.000
If you look at it,

154
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.250
the path to happiness is simple,

155
00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.375
but deep.

156
00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:33.500
It starts with

157
00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:37.250
limiting your desires,

158
00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:41.791
being content with what you have.

159
00:08:41.791 --> 00:08:44.458
And also with reducing

160
00:08:44.458 --> 00:08:49.000
your expectations from others.

161
00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.375
Only all this is in your control.

162
00:08:53.375 --> 00:08:56.041
Inner contentment doesn't mean

163
00:08:56.041 --> 00:08:59.666
you should stop, not make progress.

164
00:08:59.666 --> 00:09:02.708
Inner contentment means

165
00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:07.291
I am happy with whatever I have.

166
00:09:07.291 --> 00:09:09.791
But at the same time,

167
00:09:09.791 --> 00:09:14.125
I will keep doing karma,

168
00:09:14.125 --> 00:09:16.000
because karma is my purpose.

169
00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.041
And whatever success,

170
00:09:19.041 --> 00:09:22.625
however much success is 
obtained from doing this karma,

171
00:09:22.625 --> 00:09:25.125
I will accept it.

172
00:09:25.125 --> 00:09:28.708
And instead of getting disturbed by failures,

173
00:09:28.708 --> 00:09:31.500
I will learn from them,

174
00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.500
keep becoming better.

175
00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:38.750
Remember this definition of contentment.

176
00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.916
It will support you.

177
00:09:45.416 --> 00:09:48.000
In the professional world,

178
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.791
success comes not only from work efficiency

179
00:09:51.791 --> 00:09:57.291
but also from a pleasant and balanced mind.

180
00:09:57.291 --> 00:09:59.875
But now the question arises –

181
00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:02.833
how is this achieved in such a competition-filled

182
00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:07.375
professional environment?

183
00:10:07.375 --> 00:10:09.791
For this, it's essential –

184
00:10:09.791 --> 00:10:13.875
keeping restraint over your expectations,

185
00:10:13.875 --> 00:10:16.416
keeping attention focused

186
00:10:16.416 --> 00:10:18.500
on your professional karma,

187
00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.625
and understanding this entire process

188
00:10:20.625 --> 00:10:24.333
as a journey and enjoying it.

189
00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:28.708
Restraint over expectations–
meaning understanding

190
00:10:28.708 --> 00:10:32.333
that lasting success doesn't come quickly.

191
00:10:32.333 --> 00:10:35.125
On this path, many times

192
00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:37.583
your expectations will be fulfilled,

193
00:10:37.583 --> 00:10:39.833
many times they won't be.

194
00:10:39.833 --> 00:10:42.208
So restraint is essential.

195
00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:47.000
From this, your mind will be 
less disturbed, will remain stable.

196
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.625
And now

197
00:10:49.625 --> 00:10:51.791
keep this stable mind focused

198
00:10:51.791 --> 00:10:53.958
on your professional karma,

199
00:10:53.958 --> 00:10:58.750
because only karma is in your control.

200
00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.666
And if the work remains excellent,

201
00:11:01.666 --> 00:11:03.375
then if not today then tomorrow,

202
00:11:03.375 --> 00:11:06.625
success will come automatically.

203
00:11:06.625 --> 00:11:10.250
And professional life is a journey,

204
00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:12.000
a process –

205
00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.958
when you succeed,

206
00:11:13.958 --> 00:11:16.500
confidence increases in you.

207
00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:21.416
At the same time, failure 
also doesn't go to waste,

208
00:11:21.416 --> 00:11:25.500
but polishes your personality.

209
00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.333
Failure teaches what improvement is needed

210
00:11:29.333 --> 00:11:33.583
in thinking or in work.

211
00:11:33.583 --> 00:11:37.750
This is also a kind of guidance.

212
00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.250
Think –

213
00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.750
confidence in success and

214
00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:45.541
lesson in failure. In both situations

215
00:11:45.541 --> 00:11:48.625
you are gaining something.

216
00:11:48.625 --> 00:11:52.125
This is also progress.

217
00:11:52.125 --> 00:11:55.166
Enjoy it.

218
00:11:55.166 --> 00:11:58.916
So just remember these three mantras –

219
00:11:58.916 --> 00:12:03.500
restraint over expectations, 
paying attention to karma,

220
00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:09.833
and viewing this entire process positively.

221
00:12:09.833 --> 00:12:12.000
This is the foundation

222
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.000
of successful and balanced life.
